@Ordo.Inventory.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5257

### Health
GET {{Ordo.Inventory.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Set stock (dev-only admin endpoint, no authentication in Phase 1)
PUT {{Ordo.Inventory.Api_HostAddress}}/inventory/stock/22222222-2222-7222-8222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 10 }
